---
name: Ciclo isolation
description: Lancamentos must always include ciclo_id; mes/ano derived from ciclo not JS Date
type: feature
---
- lancamentos table has ciclo_id column (FK to ciclos)
- When saving salga (QR or manual), always set ciclo_id from the active/selected ciclo
- mes_referencia/ano_referencia must come from the ciclo's mes/ano, NOT from new Date()
- Block salga registration if no open ciclo exists
- Each ciclo is isolated: data never crosses between months
